Where is Vivi?

259
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:00,730
My.

260
00:18:01,940 --> 00:18:03,240
Awake already.

261
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:09,120
Now that I've studied your ability, this
won't turn out like it did last time.

262
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,480
Be careful, pal.

263
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,901
Don't want to overexert yourself.

264
00:18:20,940 --> 00:18:24,980
Perfect timing why don't you
save the boy before he dies?

265
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:31,637
After all if it weren't for his
courage and selflessness who knows

266
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:35,317
if your precious princess would
have made it back alive at all it

267
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:39,657
must please you to know vivi's
safe that even as we speak she's on

268
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:43,117
her way to Alubarna though it's a
long trip and anything could happen?

269
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:45,760
I guess the situation is what it is.

270
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:02,171
If I'm not able to stop her, then who can?

271
00:19:02,660 --> 00:19:05,280
Vivi must be protected
for everyone's sake!

272
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:10,600
Need meat!

273
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:15,860
So, the final revolt has begun.

274
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:17,560
There was a lone ship.

275
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:19,957
Hopefully that means
Princess Vivi and the others

276
00:19:20,040 --> 00:19:22,746
were able to make it to
Alabasta in one piece.

277
00:19:22,940 --> 00:19:23,900
I must hurry.

278
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:26,040
I pray there's still time.

279
00:19:27,580 --> 00:19:28,800
Hey, kid.

280
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,061
Are you alright?

281
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:31,240
Need meat.

282
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,270
Meat!

283
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:37,950
Meat?

284
00:19:38,340 --> 00:19:39,960
You don't need food now.

285
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:42,617
That's the least of your worries. Hang on.

286
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:44,229
I'll get a doctor for you.

287
00:19:48,300 --> 00:19:52,360
I'm going to make sure
Crocodile pays for this.

288
00:19:54,700 --> 00:20:00,100
He insulted Phoebe, and that old
man with the shovel gave me water.

289
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:03,100
He's definitely gonna pay!

290
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:07,140
Who is this person?

291
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,340
Meat.

292
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,580
There it is!

293
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:36,466
It's still in the distance,
but it's Alavarna!

294
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:40,320
Koza, we're less than
30 minutes away! Yeah.

295
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:43,320
We're nearing Alubarna now!

296
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:45,880
The time has come, men!

297
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:53,357
Chaka, we've sighted the rebel army.

298
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:55,097
They're about ten miles to the south.

299
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:58,737
Their forces are bearing down on
the southern gate as we speak.

300
00:20:58,820 --> 00:21:02,400
East, west, south, southeast, southwest!

301
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:04,544
Guard each gate with your life!

302
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:09,020
Do not let even one of them set
foot within our walls! Right!

303
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:26,800
Hey, take a look over there.

304
00:21:27,140 --> 00:21:30,728
The rebel army is approaching,
and there are so many of them.

305
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:34,497
The princess is such a little
idiot to think she can stop them.

306
00:21:34,580 --> 00:21:37,051
But then, is the little idiot even coming?

307
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:38,110
Really?

308
00:21:38,193 --> 00:21:39,037
Now will she show up?

309
00:21:39,120 --> 00:21:40,140
Or will she not?

310
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:41,580
Or will she?

311
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:43,021
Or will she not?

312
00:21:43,120 --> 00:21:44,460
The outcome is vague.

313
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,917
What, what, what, what, what?

314
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,297
Are we sure about this?

315
00:21:47,380 --> 00:21:48,297
Shouldn't we be sure?

316
00:21:48,380 --> 00:21:50,697
The princes and the pirates are
really coming right at this rate.

317
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:52,177
The rebel army's gonna beat them here.

318
00:21:52,260 --> 00:21:54,457
I thought those idiots
wanted to stop the fighting.

319
00:21:54,540 --> 00:21:56,237
Shouldn't they at least try to be on time?

320
00:21:56,320 --> 00:21:59,277
I think it's entirely possible that
they won't make it soon enough.

321
00:21:59,360 --> 00:22:01,157
It might even be likely, really.

322
00:22:01,240 --> 00:22:04,057
After all, they did lose precious
time when they were in Rain Base.

323
00:22:04,140 --> 00:22:05,320
What? They did?

324
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:06,817
All right, then.

325
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:09,157
Let's suppose the rebellion
does get started first.

326
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:12,005
What are we supposed to
do if that does happen?

327
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,871
We wouldn't have to do anything, would we?

328
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:15,950
Think about it.

329
00:22:16,033 --> 00:22:17,197
Once the rebellion gets underway,

330
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:19,977
there's nothing even the princess
will be able to do to stop it.

331
00:22:20,060 --> 00:22:23,178
All we need to do is eliminate
whoever we're told to.

332
00:22:23,700 --> 00:22:26,637
Can't you even manage to figure
that much out on your own?

333
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:29,857
It sounds like you're just dying
to see some of my dance moves.

334
00:22:29,940 --> 00:22:31,537
Just calm down and let it go, you two.

335
00:22:31,620 --> 00:22:33,160
Ah! My back! It hurts!

336
00:22:33,360 --> 00:22:34,757
Get over here and massage it, Mr.

337
00:22:34,840 --> 00:22:35,670
Four!

338
00:22:35,753 --> 00:22:39,460
They're coming now!

339
00:22:40,780 --> 00:22:41,610
Really?!

340
00:22:41,693 --> 00:22:44,060
Why did you tell us that
earlier, you idiot?!

341
00:22:48,020 --> 00:22:48,850
Ducks!

342
00:22:48,933 --> 00:22:49,763
They're on ducks!

343
00:22:50,560 --> 00:22:51,620
They're on ducks.

344
00:22:51,900 --> 00:22:52,820
Are you sure?

345
00:22:53,040 --> 00:22:54,511
Do you see anything else?

346
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:56,637
Seems like their number's gone up, too!

347
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:58,014
There are six of them!

348
00:22:58,100 --> 00:23:02,257
With Straw Hat out of the way, I thought
there was only supposed to be four left!

349
00:23:02,340 --> 00:23:04,222
Not quite, Miss Merry Christmas.

350
00:23:04,480 --> 00:23:06,277
Don't you remember what the boss said?

351
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:07,948
He told us there's that Mr.

352
00:23:08,060 --> 00:23:09,001
Prince guy, too,

353
00:23:09,100 --> 00:23:12,577
and apparently there's more than one
of them, so the numbers do add up.

354
00:23:12,660 --> 00:23:13,660
Just do the math.

355
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,837
It doesn't matter.

356
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:18,077
Phoebe is our only target.

357
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,925
What are you so worried about?

358
00:23:21,120 --> 00:23:22,020
Well, Mr.

359
00:23:22,220 --> 00:23:26,500
One, you say Princess Phoebe is
the only one we need to eliminate?

360
00:23:27,700 --> 00:23:28,530
Okay.

361
00:23:30,100 --> 00:23:33,629
Then how about you take a stab
at guessing which one she is?

362
00:23:34,100 --> 00:23:36,400
They're all wearing identical outfits!

363
00:23:38,520 --> 00:23:42,037
Even worse, those birds are the
quickest in the whole kingdom.

364
00:23:42,120 --> 00:23:43,120
Supersonic ducks.

365
00:23:48,100 --> 00:23:49,580
Those sneaky rats!

366
00:23:49,840 --> 00:23:53,237
How are we supposed to tell
which one is Phoebe like this?

367
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:55,920
It's just not a fair
thing to do, you know!

368
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,940
Let them have it down, Mr. Four!

369
00:24:12,080 --> 00:24:12,910
Dodge it!

370
00:24:16,180 --> 00:24:17,010
Miss him!

371
00:24:17,100 --> 00:24:19,159
Those damn birds, they're too fast!

372
00:24:20,740 --> 00:24:22,677
Two just broke off from the rest!

373
00:24:22,760 --> 00:24:23,995
They're splitting up!

374
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:26,497
Looks like they're planning
to go for the south!

375
00:24:26,580 --> 00:24:29,157
Those two are heading straight
toward the rebel army,

376
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:31,416
which means one of them must be Vivi.

377
00:24:31,900 --> 00:24:34,257
We'll go ahead and take care of those two.

378
00:24:34,340 --> 00:24:35,660
Move it, Mr. Four!

379
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:37,630
Ooh.

380
00:24:39,520 --> 00:24:41,460
Special attack, firestorm!

381
00:24:45,180 --> 00:24:47,677
Two more of them are
breaking off that way, Mr.

382
00:24:47,760 --> 00:24:48,590
One!

383
00:24:48,673 --> 00:24:49,503
That could be Vivi!

384
00:24:49,660 --> 00:24:52,497
Seems they're planning to
go in through the west gate.

385
00:24:52,580 --> 00:24:53,540
Damn brats.

386
00:24:54,420 --> 00:24:55,250
Let's go.

387
00:24:59,520 --> 00:25:02,320
Okay, let's head for
the southwest gate now!

388
00:25:05,520 --> 00:25:09,873
So they're going to approach three of
Alibarna's five gates from the west.

389
00:25:10,020 --> 00:25:13,037
If they're gonna split up and enter
that way, then we'll do the same thing.

390
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:15,296
We can wipe them out inside the city.

391
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:18,042
You're not getting away from me!

392
00:25:23,340 --> 00:25:24,517
Hey, someone's coming.

393
00:25:24,600 --> 00:25:25,953
Wait, is it the Rebels?

394
00:25:26,080 --> 00:25:30,400
No, wait, it's the Supersonic
Duck Squadron. Put them in.

395
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,840
I'm not kidding here.

396
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:49,647
There's no way you're
getting away with this.

397
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:53,580
Four, four, four, four.

398
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:06,459
Thank you so much for
following us all the way here!

399
00:26:06,780 --> 00:26:07,660
Say what?

400
00:26:11,740 --> 00:26:12,700
Now stop!

401
00:26:14,020 --> 00:26:16,255
Wow, you guys are very good, you know.

402
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:18,577
That's right, I'm the real Princess Beebe!

403
00:26:18,660 --> 00:26:21,177
What are you, I mean, what
are you talking about?

404
00:26:21,260 --> 00:26:23,400
I am the real Princess Beebe!

405
00:26:26,080 --> 00:26:28,600
I wonder if this is far enough now.

406
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:35,057
I have to say it's really entertaining

407
00:26:35,140 --> 00:26:37,081
how easily you all fail for this.

408
00:26:37,420 --> 00:26:41,040
Now, we can go ahead and
take these silly cloaks off.

409
00:26:42,700 --> 00:26:45,288
Too bad, it looks like
your guess was wrong!

410
00:26:49,620 --> 00:26:50,450
What?

411
00:26:57,820 --> 00:26:59,820
Thank you so much, everyone.

412
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:03,320
I have to hurry now.

413
00:27:03,600 --> 00:27:05,776
The Rebel Army is almost to the city.

414
00:27:07,320 --> 00:27:08,500
Let's go, Cotton.

415
00:27:10,800 --> 00:27:11,630
Camel!

416
00:27:12,220 --> 00:27:16,000
And I recognize you from the
ship, too, don't I? Sorry!

417
00:27:17,220 --> 00:27:18,537
Yeah, come on, Zoro!

418
00:27:18,620 --> 00:27:19,450
Let him have it!

419
00:27:19,533 --> 00:27:21,017
Would you keep quiet over there?

420
00:27:21,100 --> 00:27:22,500
They fooled us.

421
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:23,817
Quite a force.

422
00:27:23,900 --> 00:27:24,817
I don't know that anymore!

423
00:27:24,900 --> 00:27:25,782
You cleared me!

424
00:27:26,280 --> 00:27:29,045
It looks like there won't
be any rebellion now.

425
00:27:29,440 --> 00:27:30,880
What did you say?!

426
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:36,040
I have to stop them at any cost!

427
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:39,868
If I don't, then all of this
struggling has been for nothing!

428
00:27:40,740 --> 00:27:41,880
Whatever the cost,

429
00:27:42,140 --> 00:27:46,905
Phoebe and her friends must be prevented
from making contact with the rebel army.

430
00:27:53,900 --> 00:27:55,260
Secure the cannonballs!

431
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:57,257
I don't want them rolling away!

432
00:27:57,340 --> 00:27:58,458
You heard him, men!

433
00:27:58,660 --> 00:27:59,620
Men your posts!

434
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:01,781
Keep the artillery under control!

435
00:28:02,500 --> 00:28:04,441
The ground is really moving, huh?

436
00:28:04,600 --> 00:28:07,557
The enemy army is made up
of two million angry men.

437
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:10,037
Even the ground shakes
a little before them.

438
00:28:10,120 --> 00:28:10,950
Stay strong.

439
00:28:22,560 --> 00:28:23,700
It's okay, Karoo.

440
00:28:23,820 --> 00:28:25,349
You don't have to be here.

441
00:28:28,360 --> 00:28:30,889
You could get trampled,
so just be careful.

442
00:28:42,460 --> 00:28:43,360
Please, leader.

443
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:45,757
Please listen to what I have to say.

444
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:46,900
You must hear it.

445
00:28:52,760 --> 00:28:53,840
Everyone listen!

446
00:28:54,140 --> 00:28:56,117
Close your ranks and stay together!

447
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:58,597
We'll knock through the
guards at the southern gate!

448
00:28:58,680 --> 00:29:00,445
The rest will fall from there!

449
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:03,140
Do not lose arms!

450
00:29:11,940 --> 00:29:13,677
Rebel Army you must stop!

451
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:15,172
This fight is pointless!

452
00:29:15,320 --> 00:29:16,379
It's all a set up!

453
00:29:19,740 --> 00:29:20,880
Please slow down!

454
00:29:21,040 --> 00:29:22,746
You have got to listen to me!

455
00:29:27,520 --> 00:29:28,880
Rebel Army stop!

456
00:29:34,460 --> 00:29:35,290
Hey!

457
00:29:35,373 --> 00:29:37,537
Did you see a person standing
in front of us just now?

458
00:29:37,620 --> 00:29:38,450
Person!

459
00:29:38,600 --> 00:29:40,357
That isn't important right now!

460
00:29:40,440 --> 00:29:42,558
The Anomy is already shooting at us!

461
00:29:46,520 --> 00:29:47,860
Why did they do that?

462
00:29:48,180 --> 00:29:50,180
Neither side can see anything now!

463
00:29:52,660 --> 00:29:54,560
What is the Royal Army thinking?

464
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,580
What the hell?

465
00:29:57,760 --> 00:30:00,466
I haven't given anyone
the order to open fire!

466
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:02,266
Do not act without my Zeus!

467
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:04,700
Sir, I'm terribly sorry about that.

468
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:07,320
I guess my hand just slipped. Sorry.

469
00:30:27,840 --> 00:30:29,960
Don't back down! Charge through!

470
00:30:30,240 --> 00:30:31,769
It's such a cloud of sand!

471
00:30:32,060 --> 00:30:33,060
No, everyone!

472
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:34,475
You have to stop now!

473
00:30:35,260 --> 00:30:36,820
Fight for the country!

474
00:30:37,080 --> 00:30:38,520
We'll make the king pay!

475
00:30:39,580 --> 00:30:40,410
Leader!

476
00:30:50,380 --> 00:30:51,210
Leader!

477
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:03,720
Koza, what is it? Nothing. It's nothing.

478
00:31:05,840 --> 00:31:07,300
Was I imagining it?

479
00:31:21,460 --> 00:31:22,290
Leader?

480
00:31:24,840 --> 00:31:25,840
Remember, men!

481
00:31:26,080 --> 00:31:28,040
Today will be our final battle!

482
00:31:30,360 --> 00:31:31,900
Wait! Listen to me!

483
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:36,280
Weezer!

484
00:31:53,360 --> 00:31:54,480
They're here!

485
00:31:55,500 --> 00:31:57,040
Get it ready!

486
00:32:02,680 --> 00:32:04,080
Fire!

487
00:32:25,040 --> 00:32:25,870
Save the country!

488
00:32:25,953 --> 00:32:27,640
Tag down, Alubarna!

489
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:01,580
No, Karoo!

490
00:33:05,560 --> 00:33:08,260
Karoo, you shielded me from them.

491
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,540
I'm sorry.

492
00:33:13,180 --> 00:33:14,800
We've come so far.

493
00:33:15,100 --> 00:33:16,720
We've done so much.

494
00:33:17,160 --> 00:33:19,080
But the rebellion has started.

495
00:33:19,620 --> 00:33:20,860
I'm so sorry.

496
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,740
But I will stop it.

497
00:33:22,980 --> 00:33:25,745
No matter how many times
they refuse to listen,

498
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:28,056
No matter how loudly, I have to yell.

499
00:33:28,140 --> 00:33:32,177
We will not let mindless fighting
destroy what we've worked so hard for.

500
00:33:32,260 --> 00:33:35,613
That's something I learned
while I was on board the ship.

501
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:37,720
Do not ever give up!

502
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:41,470
Phoebe!

503
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,960
At last, I found you!

504
00:33:45,620 --> 00:33:46,450
Usopp!

505
00:33:46,620 --> 00:33:48,500
We can still make it in time!

506
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:50,340
Hurry and hop on! Right.

507
00:33:50,700 --> 00:33:51,960
Hang in there, Karoo.

508
00:33:52,460 --> 00:33:54,048
Oh, forget about that bird.

509
00:33:55,940 --> 00:33:57,237
What's the matter, Vivi?

510
00:33:57,320 --> 00:33:59,137
Come on, we need to get going now!

511
00:33:59,220 --> 00:34:00,050
Hurry it up!

512
00:34:04,280 --> 00:34:05,400
That... bird?

513
00:34:09,860 --> 00:34:11,280
Let's go, Karoo!

514
00:34:16,080 --> 00:34:19,160
Come on, the rebellion
will only get worse!

515
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:25,120
Usopp, prove yourself.

516
00:34:25,900 --> 00:34:27,400
Hmm? Really?

517
00:34:27,680 --> 00:34:29,504
You don't believe that it's me?

518
00:34:31,400 --> 00:34:32,230
See?

519
00:34:35,800 --> 00:34:36,630
Usopp.

520
00:34:36,713 --> 00:34:37,543
Hey, Usopp.

521
00:34:37,820 --> 00:34:38,900
Eyelash, wake up.

522
00:34:40,240 --> 00:34:41,460
Oh, it's you, Sanji.

523
00:34:41,700 --> 00:34:42,994
Is it morning already?

524
00:34:43,140 --> 00:34:44,140
Uh, sure.

525
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:46,517
So, this is how our fight turned out.

526
00:34:46,600 --> 00:34:50,482
The part of the mission where we
lured them away went really well.

527
